# edge-flows.script — task-46 edge-case flows: focus loss/gain over the
# edge-base schedule.
#
# IDENTICAL input/capture schedule to edge-base.script (same targets, same
# captures) plus leave/enter disturbance pairs (LeaveNotify/EnterNotify,
# task-25 semantics) inserted ONLY in input-free windows:
#   - title/help screen:  leave b12 -> enter b18
#   - mid-play #1:        leave b122 -> enter b132 (RunGame pause spin;
#                         frame publishes stall; boundaries tick via the
#                         static-idle escape; EnterNotify re-arms the clock)
#   - hi-score table:     leave b160 -> enter b166
#   - mid-play #2:        leave b290 -> enter b305 (long freeze, ~15 boundaries)
#   - coast mid-play #3:  leave b500 -> enter b520
#   - death table:        leave b1705 -> enter b1710
# NO gameplay keys land inside a pause window (keys pressed while paused are
# discarded by the spin BY DESIGN and would legitimately diverge).
#
# Pass: state-hash stream IDENTICAL to edge-base.script on the same backend
# (no state loss across focus loss/gain), same-named captures pixel-equal,
# frames keep publishing after every re-enter, natural 'q' exit rc=0.

1    capture help0

3    keydown h
6    keyup h
12   leave
18   enter
20   capture help_redrawn

30   keydown s
34   keyup s
60   capture start

70   keydown e
74   keyup e
80   keydown o
94   keyup o
100  keydown p
104  keyup p
115  keydown p
119  keyup p
122  leave                  # pause mid-play (publishes stall)
132  enter                  # re-arm; frames resume
140  capture gp1

150  keydown n
154  keyup n
160  leave                  # pause on the hi-score table screen
166  enter
190  capture hiscore_n

200  keydown s
204  keyup s
240  capture start2

250  keydown r
254  keyup r
260  keydown o
274  keyup o
280  keydown p
284  keyup p
290  leave                  # long pause mid-play
305  enter
320  capture gp2

330  keydown space
334  keyup space
360  capture gp3

370  keydown o
388  keyup o
400  capture gp4

500  leave                  # pause during the drift phase
520  enter

1700 capture hiscore_death

1705 leave                  # pause on the death table
1710 enter

1720 keydown q
1724 keyup q
exit
